# Cline Rules (Spoke)

Read AGENTS.md before executing any task.

## Cline Specific Instructions
1. Always use absolute paths: d:\Project\java\java-repo\spingddd\...
2. Follow the DDD dependency rule strictly.
3. Before finishing any task, run ./gradlew test and verify JaCoCo coverage is 100%.
4. If you modify the database schema, update src/main/resources/db/01-init-product.sql.